    excerpt: "Valuable networking opportunities fostering long-term partnerships and friendships.",
    body: "The first President-Secretary Meet 2025, organized by Rotaract District 3292 Nepal-Bhutan and hosted by RAC Birgunj was held on Nov 8,2025 The event focused on iencouraging teamwork, and planning future activities.\n\nFrom the Rotaract Club of Metro City, Rtr. Anusha Pandey, Rtr. Avinash Sinha, and Rtr. Utsav Shrestha attended the event and actively participated in the sessions. The program started with a lamp-lighting ceremony in the presence of the Mayor of Birgunj Metropolitan City, marking a positive beginning to the meet.\n\nThe event included networking, exchanging letterheads, discussions on new district regulations, and updates on upcoming events like the Rotaract District Conference. Fun activities such as singing, dancing, and interactive games added to the experience.\n\nEven with the hot weather, the event was appreciated for its smooth management and the useful ideas shared. It became a great platform for Rotaractors to learn, connect, and strengthen their commitment to serving the community.",
