    body: "A joint meeting with the Rotaract Club of JIMS Vasant Kunj was conducted to discuss the twinship agreement and explore opportunities for future project collaboration between both clubs. The meeting began with a warm round of introductions, where members from both sides shared their roles, experiences, and ongoing initiatives, helping create a comfortable and collaborative environment.\n\nDuring the discussion, both clubs presented their flagship projects and highlighted the awards and recognition received over the years. This exchange not only showcased the strengths of each club but also helped identify common areas of interest and potential synergy.\n\nThe teams further reviewed the twinship renewal criteria, ensuring clarity on expectations, responsibilities, and the vision for continued partnership. Additionally, several events and initiatives were proposed for co-hosting, with members brainstorming activities where both clubs could work together to create a larger community impact.\n\nOverall, the meeting was productive and encouraging, laying a strong foundation for renewed collaboration and long-term fellowship between the two clubs.",
