    excerpt: "Participation in the Grant Management Seminar improved the club’s competence in identifying, applying for, and managing Rotary grants, thereby increasing the potential for…",
    body: "On June 13, 2025, members of the Rotaract Club of Metrocity actively participated in the Grant Management Seminar organized for Rotary Year 2025/26 at Ullens School, Lalitpur. The seminar served as a crucial capacity-building platform aimed at equipping Rotaractors with essential knowledge and practical skills for effective grant management and the successful implementation of community service projects.\n\nThe session provided a comprehensive understanding of Rotary grant opportunities, particularly District Grants and Global Grants. Facilitators offered detailed insights into grant eligibility criteria, application processes, compliance requirements, and best practices for securing and utilizing funds efficiently. The knowledge gained from this seminar has significantly strengthened the club’s ability to plan, execute, and sustain impactful community-based initiatives.",
    objectives: "To enhance members’ understanding of Rotary grant opportunities, including District and Global Grants.\n\nTo build capacity among Rotaractors in grant management, application procedures, and compliance requirements.\n\nTo equip the club with practical tools for planning and implementing impactful community service projects.\n\nTo strengthen accountability and sustainability in future grant-funded initiatives.",
