    gallery: ["https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1748185861-1276a270-3f70-4c3b-8056-a954b525eb75.jpeg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1748185861-b302ea23-b03d-4517-a784-54639d06dfd5.jpeg"],
    excerpt: "Enhanced collaboration between clubs and good relation with parent club.",
    body: "Rotaract Club of Metro City Hosts Joint Meeting with Rotary Club of Kathmandu Metro and Rotaract Club of Kathmandu Metro\n\nThe Rotaract Club of Metro City, in collaboration with its parent organization, the Rotary Club of Kathmandu Metro, and its sister club, the Rotaract Club of Kathmandu Metro, successfully hosted a joint meeting at the Alpha Beta venue in New Baneshwor. This significant event marked the 382th meeting of the Rotaract Club of Metro City.\n\nDuring the meeting, we had the opportunity to share comprehensive updates about our club's activities, achievements, and future plans. The club members engaged in meaningful discussions, exchanged valuable insights, and fostered a spirit of camaraderie and collaboration.\n\nA key highlight of the meeting was the presentation of various agendas aimed at enhancing the club's impact and outreach. These agendas encompassed upcoming projects, community service initiatives, and strategies for member engagement and development.\n\nThe joint meeting underscored the strong bond and mutual support between the Rotaract and Rotary clubs, as well as the collaborative efforts within the Rotaract community. It was a testament to our shared commitment to service above self and the collective endeavor to make a positive difference in our community.\n\nWe extend our heartfelt gratitude to all members and participants for their active involvement and contributions, making this joint meeting a resounding success.",
    objectives: "- Foster Collaboration: Strengthen the relationship between Rotaract Club of Metro City, Rotary Club of Kathmandu Metro, and Rotaract Club of Kathmandu Metro.\n\n- Share Updates: Provide comprehensive updates about the activities, achievements, and plans of the Rotaract Club of Metro City.\n\n- Present Agendas: Discuss and present key agendas, including upcoming projects and community service initiatives.\n\n- Engage Members: Enhance member engagement and development through active participation and discussion.\n\n- Promote Camaraderie: Encourage a spirit of camaraderie and mutual support among club members.\n\n- Community Impact: Strategize on increasing the club’s impact and outreach in the community.",
