    category: "DRR Visit",
    cover: "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1748184765-a1ea9ce4-b514-4dda-948b-bc49693a2ba7.jpeg",
    gallery: ["https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1748184765-a1ea9ce4-b514-4dda-948b-bc49693a2ba7.jpeg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1748184765-65d46bef-4c88-4e84-ab2a-cc324c6df6db.jpeg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1748184765-b254373f-609c-4c37-ab98-ab21ac844a13.jpeg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1748184765-583edfc4-1291-4d09-bedd-5892c47ed0aa.jpeg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1748184765-81d06260-7306-42c5-b588-4596d9c97b9f.jpeg"],
    excerpt: "Insights of DRR, DS, and other district team members were valuable to the club.",
    body: "﻿Meeting Chaired by:\n\nPresident Rtr. Sweta Shrestha\n\nWelcome and Opening:\n\nThe meeting commenced with Secretary Rtr. Anusha Pandey welcoming all attendees. Sergeant-at-Arms Rtr. Uday Lamichhane initiated the session, requested attendees to maintain proper decorum, and formally handed over the collar, gong, and gavel to the President.\n\nPresident Rtr. Sweta Shrestha officially called the meeting to order at 2:00 PM, followed by a 15-second silent invocation observed by all attendees.\n\nAgenda: DRR Visit\n\nPresident Rtr. Sweta Shrestha warmly welcomed and acknowledged the dignitaries present:\n\nIPDRR/Acting DRR Rtr. Roshan Karki\n\nDistrict Public Image Chair Rtr. Sunil Shahi\n\nZRR Zone XIII Rtr. Sairus Adhikari\n\nZRR Zone XII Rtr. Diya Shrestha\n\nShe highlighted the importance of their visit and its contribution to strengthening the Rotaract network.\n\nRemarks from IPDRR Roshan Karki:\n\nRtr. Roshan Karki shared insights from his Rotaract journey and reaffirmed his commitment to supporting clubs. He congratulated President-Elect Rtr. Anusha Pandey, encouraging her to lead with confidence and seek guidance when needed.\n\nClub Reports Presentation:\n\n1. Secretary Report - Rtr. Anusha Pandey\n\nCharter Details: Shared the club’s founding history and appreciated the chartered president’s contributions.\n\nMembership: Presented total membership data, highlighting gender inclusivity.\n\nMeetings: Summarized all conducted meetings and their consistency.\n\nBoard of Directors: Outlined the roles and achievements of current BOD members.\n\n2. Club Administration - Rtr. Uday Lamichhane\n\nDetailed various projects and their successful implementation.\n\n3. Professional Development - Rtr. Ninamma Rai\n\nPresented skill-enhancing projects and career-oriented initiatives conducted throughout the year.\n\n4. Community Service - Rtr. Nirogya Prasai\n\nShared impactful community outreach programs and their alignment with sustainable goals.\n\n5. Public Image - Rtr. Samikshya Sharma\n\nReported on strategies to boost the club’s visibility and maintain active engagement on public platforms.\n\nEach report showcased detailed planning, execution, and the dedication of members, with collective suggestions for improvement and efficiency moving forward.\n\nSpecial Acknowledgements:\n\nSincere gratitude extended to IPDRR Roshan Karki and ZRR Diya Shrestha for their insightful presence and contributions.\n\nKey Personnel Present:\n\nRtr. Sweta Shrestha - President\n\nRtr. Anusha Pandey - Secretary\n\nRtr. Asesha Mali - Immediate Past President\n\nRtr. Utsav Shrestha - Past President\n\nRtr. Uday Lamichhane - Club Admin\n\nRtr. Samikshya Sharma - Public Image Chair\n\nRtr. Ninamma Rai - Professional Development Chair\n\nRtr. Nirogya Prasai - General Member\n\nZRR: Rtr. Diya Shrestha\n\nClosing:\n\nWith all reports reviewed and feedback noted, President Rtr. Sweta Shrestha formally adjourned the meeting. She thanked all members for their participation and expressed heartfelt appreciation for the continued support from district representatives.",
