    body: "The Rotaract Club of Metro City successfully established a Twin Club relationship with the Rotaract Club of JIIMS, Vasant Kunj , RI Distrct 3012 through the official signing of a Memorandum of Understanding (MoU). This international collaboration aims to promote cross-border friendship, cultural exchange, and joint service initiatives between the two clubs. As part of the initiative, both clubs held a joint meeting where members introduced their clubs, shared experiences, and discussed future plans for continued collaboration.\n\nTo kickstart the partnership, the clubs organized a LinkedIn Optimization Workshop focused on enhancing members’ professional presence and digital networking skills. This impactful session provided practical tips on building strong LinkedIn profiles, content strategy, and leveraging the platform for career growth. Together, these activities have not only strengthened international ties but also empowered members with valuable leadership and professional development.",
