    excerpt: "The District Governor’s visit provided the Rotaract Club of Metro City with valuable insights, motivation, and recognition. It strengthened our relationship with the parent Rotary…",
    body: "On 17th December 2024, the Rotaract Club of Metro City co-hosted the Rotary District Governor Visit program at Alphabeta Complex, New Baneshwor, Kathmandu, in collaboration with our parent club, the Rotary Club of Kathmandu Metro. The meeting was graced by District Governor Rtn. Rajendra Man Senchen and other respected members of the Rotary and Rotaract fraternity.\n\nThe objective of the meeting was to share updates on completed projects, exchange ideas, and receive guidance from the District leadership. Representatives from Rotaract Club of Metro City actively participated in the discussion and presented key highlights of the club’s recent activities.\n\nDistrict Governor Rtn. Senchen acknowledged the efforts of the club and encouraged further community-based initiatives. The interaction was meaningful, as it fostered a deeper connection between Rotary and Rotaract while offering motivation to continue impactful service.\n\nThe Rotaract Club of Metro City expresses sincere gratitude to the Rotary Club of Kathmandu Metro and the District Governor for their guidance and support.",
