    gallery: ["https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1747939464-23c91498-6ce2-4f82-b8d3-8f76a42a2a03.jpeg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1747939464-02dffad7-74e1-425b-b901-159b11fe7860.jpeg"],
    excerpt: "The Heritage Picnic offered Rotaractors of Zone XII a refreshing break from routine, fostering stronger bonds, joyful memories, and enhanced inter-club fellowship. It created a relaxed…",
    body: "The Rotaract Club of Metro City was delighted to participate in the “Heritage Picnic,” a zonal fellowship event organized by Rotaract Zone XII and graciously hosted by the Rotaract Club of Patan Heritage. Held on December 7, 2024, at the serene Changunarayan Jungle, the picnic commenced at 12 PM and provided the perfect escape into nature for Rotaractors across the zone.\n\nThe event brought together members from various clubs, creating a vibrant atmosphere filled with joy and camaraderie. From our club, several enthusiastic members joined in and actively participated in the wide range of activities offered. These included exciting group games, lively music, spontaneous dance sessions, and a refreshing hike that allowed everyone to enjoy the beauty of the natural surroundings.\n\nA key highlight of the picnic was the emphasis on fellowship. The relaxed setting encouraged meaningful conversations and laughter, helping members build stronger bonds not just within our club, but with Rotaractors from other clubs as well. Delicious food and drinks added to the charm of the day, ensuring that everyone left with full hearts and fuller stomachs.\n\nWe would like to extend our sincere thanks to the organizing committee and the Rotaract Club of Patan Heritage for curating such a memorable and well-coordinated event. The Heritage Picnic truly embodied the spirit of Rotaract by combining fun, nature, and friendship in one unforgettable day.",
    objectives: "Foster Fellowship: To strengthen the bonds among Rotaractors from different clubs within Zone XII through shared experiences and informal interactions.Encourage Networking: To provide a platform for members to meet, connect, and build relationships for future collaboration on inter-club projects and initiatives.Promote Well-being: To offer a refreshing break from daily routines through nature-based activities, enhancing mental well-being and team spirit.Celebrate Rotaract Spirit: To reinforce the values of unity, friendship, and service that define the Rotaract movement in a relaxed and joyous setting.Enhance Club Participation: To encourage active involvement of club members in zonal-level events, fostering a sense of belonging and broader engagement.Create Lasting Memories: To ensure a memorable experience that cultivates happiness, fun, and a positive association with Rotaract beyond formal settings.",
