    cover: "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1747887806-1411ae24-353b-4604-bdfe-f08028e25c8e.jpg",
    gallery: ["https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1747887806-1411ae24-353b-4604-bdfe-f08028e25c8e.jpg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1747887806-55e189e5-341b-44e2-a689-0559a9dbc1f0.jpg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1747887806-2dfdfe5c-679a-4dee-aaf7-d4a6e3da1722.jpg"],
    excerpt: "The \"Donation to Oxsa Nepal\" project enhances animal welfare, strengthens community ties, raises awareness, promotes volunteerism, and ensures long-term support for the shelter.",
    body: "The Rotaract Club of Metro City was honored to participate in the \"Donation to Oxsa Nepal\" event, organized by our twin club, the Rotaract Club of Durbarmarg, on their 15th Charter's Day. Oxsa Nepal is a dedicated dog shelter that has been providing care and shelter to street dogs and cats for the past 15 years. On August 12th, we joined the Rotaract Club of Durbarmarg at Oxsa Nepal to contribute to this noble cause. The shelter currently houses 30 dogs, 2 cats, 1 pigeon, and 1 crow, all of whom rely on the generosity of donors for their daily needs. Our collective donation included essential food items such as a sack of rice, three types of lentils (1 kg each), and a can of tuna fish. Additionally, the Rotary Club of Durbarmarg and a past president contributed funds totaling Rs. 5000 to support the shelter's ongoing efforts. During our visit, we had the opportunity to interact with the shelter's owner and learn about their selfless dedication to caring for these animals. It was a heartwarming experience to see the impact of our contributions firsthand and to spend time with the furry residents of Oxsa Nepal. We are grateful for the invitation to be part of this meaningful event and look forward to continuing our support for Oxsa Nepal in the future.",
    objectives: "Provide essential food supplies and financial support to Oxsa Nepal to ensure the well-being and care of the shelter's animals, including dogs, cats, and birds.Foster collaboration and partnership between the Rotaract Club of Metro City and the Rotaract Club of Durbarmarg, enhancing the sense of community and shared purpose.Increase awareness about the needs and challenges faced by animal shelters like Oxsa Nepal, and the importance of supporting such organizations.Promote active participation and volunteerism among club members, encouraging them to engage in meaningful community service activities.Establish a lasting relationship with Oxsa Nepal to ensure ongoing support and collaboration for future initiatives and projects.",
