    gallery: ["https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1747840088-4117de02-5485-496c-80df-26a7f844d8a1.jpg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1747840088-1c0dd207-60bd-474c-ac48-2d75859835b8.jpg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1747840088-f65a7ff1-19d5-4303-b16b-74ec34f1d21b.jpg"],
    excerpt: "The Charter Day celebration fostered deeper fellowship between RAC Metro City and RAC Durbarmarg, strengthening the twin club bond. It provided an opportunity to honor achievements…",
    body: "On the joyous occasion of the 15th Charter Day of our beloved twin club, the Rotaract Club of Durbarmarg, the Rotaract Club of Metro City had the privilege of joining the celebration, held with warmth and togetherness. The event served as a beautiful reminder of the journey, achievements, and growth of RAC Durbarmarg over the past 15 years, and we were honored to be part of this special milestone.\n\nThe celebration was marked by heartfelt interactions, joyful conversations, and cheerful moments shared among members. The highlight of the evening was the cake-cutting ceremony, which symbolized another successful year of service, leadership, and unity. Members enjoyed delicious food and engaged in meaningful exchanges, further strengthening the sense of fellowship that defines the spirit of Rotaract.\n\nWith a total of 13 members present, the gathering was cozy yet vibrant. Our presence as a twin club added an extra layer of warmth and excitement to the celebration, and we were warmly welcomed and appreciated throughout the evening. The event concluded with a group photo session, capturing the smiles, memories, and camaraderie of the day.\n\nFor the Rotaract Club of Metro City, this celebration was more than just a social event-it was a reaffirmation of the strong bond shared between our clubs. We extend our heartfelt congratulations to RAC Durbarmarg on reaching this milestone and look forward to many more years of collaboration, friendship, and shared impact.",
    objectives: "To celebrate the 15th Charter Day of RAC Durbarmarg and honor their journey and achievements.To strengthen the bond of friendship and collaboration between the twin clubs.To foster fellowship and create a space for joyful interactions among members.To acknowledge and appreciate the spirit of unity and continuity within the Rotaract movement.",
