    gallery: ["https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1748186921-7936a8b4-6ec7-40a1-a5ba-ce2ba9723ef3.jpeg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1748186921-cb850f26-0a63-4adf-b3c6-378bda264e4a.jpeg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1748186921-0f0eeb94-bf87-4706-ac48-f4637ec82adf.jpeg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1748186921-0b645cda-8dd6-4d9c-bf8f-6b99cff6122b.jpeg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1748186921-eb4cede7-1ec7-46ba-bc17-8d90f4738e71.jpeg"],
    excerpt: "This project helped members gain a deeper understanding of the Rotaract movement, fostering increased engagement, awareness, and leadership within the club.",
    body: "The Rotaract Club of Metro City successfully organized a Guest Speaker Session during its 358th club meeting, featuring Mr. Peshal Bhattarai as the guest speaker. The session focused on the topic “Introduction to Rotaract”, aimed at orienting both new and existing members about the core values, history, and significance of the Rotaract movement.\n\nMr. Bhattarai delivered an insightful presentation that covered:\n\nThe origin and global evolution of the Rotaract movement.\n\nCore values: Leadership, Fellowship, Service, and Professional Development.\n\nThe relationship between Rotary and Rotaract.\n\nOpportunities within Rotaract at the club, district, and international levels.\n\nThe importance of youth engagement in community service and leadership.\n\nInteractive Discussion: Members actively participated in the Q&A session, where Mr. Bhattarai addressed various queries and shared motivational insights.\n\nTakeaways: The session successfully motivated attendees to explore deeper involvement in club activities and understand the broader vision of Rotaract.",
    objectives: "To provide a clear and concise understanding of what Rotaract is.\n\nTo educate members about the history, purpose, and structure of the Rotaract movement.\n\nTo inspire greater involvement and leadership within the club.\n\nTo foster a sense of belonging and responsibility among members.",
