    gallery: ["https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1748003346-34c5a325-9aeb-4503-bc08-70bf606269de.jpg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1748003346-f1b17194-ab61-4470-925d-5b2c49ff2fe5.jpg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1748003346-dc5058d5-06ce-4957-959a-75232e830fe9.jpg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1748003346-e82d723d-bec9-47be-96fe-5a4b6121430c.jpg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1748003346-6e3bc35e-090d-4e9a-a15e-9ef06bda660a.jpg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1748003346-69ca036c-9140-45dd-9250-518802620ec3.jpg"],
    excerpt: "The 17th District Assembly, DLTS, and Recognition Seminar offered great value to Rotaract members and clubs. Focused training sessions equipped club leaders with essential skills in…",
    body: "On June 29, 2024, the Rotaract Club of Metro City proudly participated in the 17th District Assembly, District Leadership Training Seminar (DLTS), and Award Ceremony held at Siddhartha Vanasthali Institute, Banasthali. This remarkable event brought together Rotaractors from across the district to enhance their leadership capacities, celebrate club achievements, and strengthen inter-club connections. The day featured parallel training sessions focused on key roles-President, Secretary, Treasurer, and Avenue Directors-offering targeted guidance on leadership development, strategic planning, financial management, and effective project execution. The program officially commenced with an inspiring opening by the District Rotaract Representative (DRR), setting the tone for a day rich in collaboration and growth.\n\nThe highlight of the event was the Award Ceremony, where the Rotaract Club of Metro City was recognized with several prestigious honors. The club was awarded the Vibrant Gold with a Perfect Score. Additionally, the club received the Best Project Award for its excellence in the DRR thematic area, impactful service projects, and professional development initiatives. The event concluded with a spirited fellowship session that celebrated unity, reinforced bonds among Rotaractors, and reignited a shared passion for service and leadership across the district.",
    objectives: "Empower the incoming tenure and club officers with essential skills through in-depth training and practical learning experiences tailored to their specific roles.\n\nAcknowledge and celebrate the outstanding contributions and achievements of clubs and leaders during the Rotaract Year 2023/24.",
