    cover: "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1718441886-8d6ce5b9-d15c-433d-8bd8-fe1e397c1ba6.jpeg",
    gallery: ["https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1718441886-8d6ce5b9-d15c-433d-8bd8-fe1e397c1ba6.jpeg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1718441886-6a357873-4791-4f14-b738-747265c75318.jpeg"],
    excerpt: "Enhancing knowledge about road safety rules and the importance of responsible driving.",
    body: "The Rotaract Club of Metro City recently hosted a comprehensive online awareness session dedicated to promoting road safety. This initiative aimed to educate the community on the critical importance of responsible driving, adherence to traffic laws, and proactive safety measures. Through engaging presentations, interactive discussions, and expert insights, participants were informed about the dangers of distracted driving, the necessity of seatbelt use, and the importance of respecting all road users, including pedestrians and cyclists.\n\nIn addition to the online session, the Rotaract Club has shared detailed posts on social media platforms, including Instagram, to further spread the message of road safety. These posts are designed to reach a broad audience, providing valuable information and practical tips that can help individuals make safer choices on the road. By leveraging the power of social media, the Rotaract Club of Metro City is able to engage with a wider community, raising awareness and encouraging everyone to take responsibility for creating safer roads.",
    objectives: "Educate the Community: Provide critical information on responsible driving and adherence to traffic laws.\n\nPromote Safety Measures: Highlight the importance of seatbelt use, avoiding distractions, and respecting all road users.\n\n- Engage Through Online Sessions: Host interactive discussions and presentations featuring expert insights on road safety.\n\n- Leverage Social Media: Share informative posts on platforms like Instagram to reach a wider audience.\n\n- Encourage Community Responsibility: Urge individuals to take proactive steps in contributing to safer roads.\n\n- Raise Awareness: Increase public knowledge about the dangers of impaired and distracted driving.\n\n- Foster Interactive Learning: Use digital platforms to facilitate discussions and answer community questions about road safety.",
    metrics: [{ label: "Volunteer hrs", value: "15" }, { label: "Members", value: "15" }],
