    gallery: ["https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1747650125-5af04ee8-b511-44dd-afce-f6159f12e467.jpeg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1747650125-2efe95d0-2e5d-45f4-872b-e6975215eca4.jpeg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1747650125-11b12e54-b2cd-4115-8b1c-e2a0c85ca72c.jpeg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1747650125-fc625992-f13f-49e5-8092-4c2ddd5e0ef6.jpeg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1747650125-e74b1838-146c-4026-86d6-351c382edf32.jpeg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1747650125-aff03a19-f338-40a5-9a2c-af0b6b2022dc.jpeg"],
    excerpt: "It helps strengthening fellowship among members and increasing the club’s visibility in the community. It provides a platform to showcase culture, engage non-Rotaractors, and attract…",
    body: "On March 13, 2025, the Rotaract Club of Metro City, in collaboration with fellow Rotaract clubs, successfully organized a grand celebration titled \"Holique 2025\" at Shrey Courtyard, Kathmandu, as a part of the World Rotaract Week. The event was a vibrant celebration of Holi, the festival of colors, and turned out to be an outstanding success, drawing a massive crowd of over 700 attendees. The diverse gathering included Rotaractors from various clubs, alumni, community members, and non-Rotaractors, making it a truly inclusive and community-oriented celebration.\n\nHolique 2025 embraced the essence of joy, unity, and cultural harmony. The event featured lively music, dance performances, and playful color splashes, creating a cheerful and high-spirited atmosphere for everyone present. Participants were seen enjoying the beats of DJ music, engaging in interactive games, and taking part in cheerful group dances, all of which contributed to creating vibrant and cherished memories. The spirit of the festival was evident as people of different backgrounds came together, laughed, danced, and celebrated in unity.\n\nThis celebration not only enhanced the fellowship among Rotaractors but also served as a platform to connect with the wider community, helping increase the visibility and impact of Rotaract. The event exemplified the values of togetherness, inclusion, and social harmony, reflecting the true spirit of Holi and the purpose of Rotaract in building strong community ties.\n\nMoreover, Holique served as an ideal example of how cultural celebrations can be transformed into impactful social events. The joy and energy experienced by all those in attendance were a testament to the event's success. Attendees appreciated the warm hospitality, engaging activities, and the seamless coordination among organizing clubs.\n\nWith such an overwhelming response, Holique 2025 not only marked a colorful highlight of World Rotaract Week but also left a lasting impression as a day filled with laughter, connection, and cultural pride. It stood as a beautiful reminder of how celebrations can unite people and strengthen the bonds of community and friendship.",
    objectives: "• To promote fellowship and unity among members and the community.\n\n• To celebrate and preserve cultural traditions in a joyful and inclusive way.\n\n• To provide a fun, stress-relieving experience that strengthens club bonds.\n\n• To enhance the club’s public image through vibrant cultural engagement.\n\n• To use the festive occasion as an opportunity for social impact or awareness.",
