    gallery: ["https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1710830180-a9ec6fd3-fc04-4c3f-8ea1-d8aea242abca.jpeg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1710830180-0ba90b30-0b65-4412-a57b-f13e699f0367.jpeg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1710830180-94f53228-73d2-434b-a5c6-2b7797b5beec.jpeg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1710830180-49aa3766-96ff-45a2-bfa7-4f5c0131ba7d.jpeg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1710830180-23fb4966-b77c-4582-8528-a21fd03de28f.jpeg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1710830180-8673154b-ba9b-487d-93ef-e0a6ecc7c727.jpeg"],
    excerpt: "N/A",
    body: "In collaboration with our esteemed Parent Club, Rotary Club of Kathmandu Metro, we orchestrated an enlightening session focused on Nurturing Mental Wellbeing for the students of Class 11 and 12 at Shivapuri Secondary School, Maharajgunj, Kathmandu. Renowned psychiatrist Dr. Dhurva Man Shrestha, known for his expertise in mental health advocacy, graced us as the distinguished speaker for the occasion.\n\nThe session served as a vital platform for engaging discussions, where Dr. Shrestha passionately addressed the multifaceted aspects of mental health, emphasizing the importance of self-care, stress management, and seeking professional help when needed. His insights not only resonated deeply with the students but also provided practical strategies for coping with various mental health challenges.",
    objectives: "- Collaborative session with Rotary Club of Kathmandu Metro.\n\n- Targeted students: Class 11 and 12 at Shivapuri Secondary School, Maharajgunj, Kathmandu.\n\n- Speaker: Dr. Dhurva Man Singh, discussing mental wellbeing.\n\n*Topics covered:\n\n- Stress management\n\n- Cyberbullying awareness\n\n- Seeking professional help\n\n- Aimed to engage students and raise awareness about mental health.",
