    excerpt: "Fellowship with other clubs members",
    body: "The Rotaract Club of Metro City, in collaboration with RAC Kathmandu Metro and Patan, organized a delightful event filled with fun and excitement. Together, we embarked on a memorable journey to Ghyalchowk, creating cherished memories along the way.\n\nOur adventure began with a scenic bus ride from Kathmandu to Ghyalchowk, where we indulged in a refreshing roadside breakfast, fueling ourselves for the day's activities. Upon arrival, we immersed ourselves in the serenity of the surroundings, soaking in the natural beauty of the area.\n\nThe highlight of the day was undoubtedly the camaraderie we shared as we cooked a delicious meal together and enjoyed it as a group. Laughter echoed as we engaged in various games and activities, fostering bonds of friendship and unity.\n\nAs the day drew to a close, we bid farewell to Ghyalchowk, filled with a sense of contentment and happiness from the unforgettable experiences we shared. Our journey back home was marked by reflections on the joyous moments we had created together, strengthening our resolve to continue fostering community and camaraderie through such events.",
    objectives: "- Rotaract Club of Metro City, along with RAC Kathmandu Metro and Patan, organized a joyful outing to Ghyalchowk.\n\n- Highlights included a scenic bus ride, a roadside breakfast, and cooking and sharing a meal together.\n\n- The day was filled with fun activities and games, strengthening bonds among participants.\n\n- The event concluded with fond farewells, leaving lasting memories for all involved.",
