    gallery: ["https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1718450161-cd35028a-7b9e-4d04-8328-8796dbcc73b6.jpeg", "https://my.rotaract3292.org/storage/report_images/1718450161-194e7303-7374-4869-9ff8-549d3764fb15.jpeg"],
    excerpt: "The induction of five new members during the 11th Installation Ceremony of the Rotaract Club of Metro City enriches our club with diverse talents and perspectives. This expansion not…",
    body: "On July 22nd, the Rotaract Club of Metro City proudly welcomed five new members into its community during a memorable induction ceremony. This significant event took place amidst the esteemed presence of District Rotaract Representative (DRR) Rtr. Roshan Karki, adding a special honor to the occasion.\n\nThe induction of these new members was a highlight of the club's 11th Installation Ceremony, held to mark the beginning of a new term and celebrate leadership within the club. Members and guests alike gathered to witness this symbolic initiation, reinforcing the club's commitment to growth and service.\n\nThe presence of DRR Rtr. Roshan Karki underscored the importance of leadership and mentorship within the Rotaract community, inspiring both existing and new members to uphold the values of Rotary and contribute meaningfully to society.\n\nThe Rotaract Club of Metro City expresses gratitude to DRR Rtr. Roshan Karki for his participation and guidance during this memorable ceremony. The induction of new members not only enriches the club's diversity but also strengthens its capacity to impact the community positively.\n\nList of Members :",
    objectives: "- Membership Expansion: Increase club membership by inducting five new members, enhancing diversity and skills within the club.\n\n- Symbolic Ceremony: Conduct a meaningful induction during the 11th Installation Ceremony to mark the start of a new term and celebrate leadership.\n\n- Leadership Recognition: Honor District Rotaract Representative (DRR) Rtr. Roshan Karki's role in mentoring and inspiring members.\n\n- Community Impact: Strengthen the club's commitment to Rotary values and community service through new member contributions.\n\n- Engagement and Integration: Foster new members' active participation and integration into club activities and initiatives.",
