    excerpt: "N/A",
    body: "Grateful for a Successful Blood Donation Program! Rotary Club of Kathmandu Metro, in association with Kantipur Management Pvt. Ltd., achieved 42 pints of blood collection. Many thanks to Rotary Blood Bank Lalitpur for their collection team and kits, Kantipur Management team for logistics, and Rotaract Club of Metro City for field support. A heartfelt appreciation to the 42 donors, the true life-savers!\n\nRotary club of Kathamandu Metro, in association with Kantipur Management Pvt. Ltd. achieved 42 pints of blood collection. Many thanks to Rotary Blood Bank Lalitpur for their collection team and kits, Kantipur Management team for logistics, and Rotaract Club of Metro City for field support. A heartfelt appreciation to the 42 donors, the true life-savers. Rotaract Club of Metro City President Rtr. Ashesha Mali and Immediate Past President Rtr. Subin Tandukar also donated blood. Our member Rtr, Rajan Maharjan, Rtr. Subin Tandukar, Rtr. Ashesha Mali, Rtr. Utsav Shrestha, Rtr. Sweta Shrestha, Rtr. Rohan Raj Gautam, Rtr. Anusha Pandey and Rtr. Sujit Khadka was presented to volunteer the Blood donation event.",
