    excerpt: "Participants gained a deeper understanding of effective leadership practices and governance within the club, empowering them to lead with confidence.",
    body: "The Rotaract Club of Metro City recently organized an insightful Club COTS (Club Officer Training Seminar) dedicated to enhancing the knowledge and skills of its members. Held with enthusiasm and commitment, the seminar featured our esteemed past president, Rtr. Utsav Shrestha, as the keynote speaker. His experience and dedication shone through as he guided us through essential rules and regulations pertinent to club operations.\n\nRtr. Utsav Shrestha meticulously outlined the responsibilities and avenues available to the board of directors, providing invaluable insights into effective leadership and governance within our club. His thorough explanation of these crucial aspects ensured that every member gained a comprehensive understanding of their roles and duties.\n\nThe session proved to be incredibly fruitful, offering a platform for interactive learning and thoughtful discussion among attendees. Members expressed gratitude to Rtr. Utsav Shrestha for his time, effort, and dedication in imparting such vital knowledge.\n\nAs a club, we are inspired and motivated to apply these learnings to our daily activities and upcoming projects. The Club COTS not only strengthened our foundational understanding but also fostered a sense of unity and shared purpose among members. We look forward to implementing these insights to further enhance our club's impact and success in serving the community.",
    objectives: "- Enhance Member Knowledge and Skills: Provide members with comprehensive training to enhance their understanding of club operations, rules, and regulations.\n\n- Leadership Development: Equip participants with insights into effective leadership and governance, as outlined by experienced speakers like Rtr. Utsav Shrestha.\n\n- Clarify Responsibilities: Ensure all members gain a clear understanding of their roles and duties within the club's board of directors.\n\n- Facilitate Interactive Learning: Create a platform for interactive learning and discussion, encouraging active participation and engagement among attendees.\n\n- Express Gratitude: Acknowledge and appreciate the contributions of keynote speakers, mentors, and organizers for their dedication and efforts.\n\n- Inspire Application of Knowledge: Motivate members to apply the acquired knowledge and skills to improve club operations and project execution.\n\n- Promote Unity and Purpose: Foster a sense of unity and shared purpose among members, strengthening camaraderie and collaboration within the club.\n\n- Drive Community Impact: Use enhanced knowledge and skills to positively impact the community through effective project planning and execution.",
